    <string name="welcome_title">Welcome to MusicBabe</string>
    <string name="welcome_body">Home is the online zone: search any song or video and it plays in full. Your phone music is in Library.\n\nIn the player, the tune icon opens the listening options: sleep timer, alarm, quality, smart playlists and more.\n\nSign in to YouTube Music from the account icon for your likes and playlists. Save a Gemini key in Settings, AI to sync lyrics, recognise songs and learn what they are about.</string>
